      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEAUTIFUL CHILD (5) thrives over the longer races. Last start was sixth over 715m at Sandown in a S/E Group 1 (42.35). Has a strong record here at this journey including four wins. Has a strong record from box 5, including two wins. Has winning claims on her best figures. UNREAL SPEED (1) is an accomplished stayer with a great record at the longer races. Was seventh last time (25.91) over 457m at Q Lakeside in a Mix 5 but is better suited by the longer journey. Form at the trip excellent including eight wins. Comes through a solid form race last start. Can measure up this time. STARFIRE TEARS (2) was out of character last run when missing the frame, finishing fourth (35.10) in a OPEN at this track. Normally fast to begin but shuffled back last time. Form here at the trip sound including seven wins. Should be about the money. BACARDI GIRL (8) warrants respect following a recent placing at big odds.",
